{"talk_id":801,"video_id":"XYsECn5IRn4","title":"From Scheduler to Events: Rethinking Alerts in a Modular System","language":"en","auto_generated":true,"source":"yt","timing":"exact","word_count":2306,"segments":[{"start":12.44,"duration":5.28,"text":"Okay, it's the last presentation of the"},{"start":15.8,"duration":4.16,"text":"day."},{"start":17.72,"duration":4.6,"text":"And we're turning to a very familiar"},{"start":19.96,"duration":4.32,"text":"challenge in enterprise systems."},{"start":22.32,"duration":4.16,"text":"How to modernize something important"},{"start":24.28,"duration":4.84,"text":"without pretending you can rewrite the"},{"start":26.48,"duration":4.92,"text":"whole world overnight."},{"start":29.12,"duration":5.72,"text":"Cristina Musculino is a software"},{"start":31.4,"duration":6.08,"text":"developer working in a a large scale"},{"start":34.84,"duration":4.84,"text":"enterprise systems with a strong focus"},{"start":37.48,"duration":5.92,"text":"on software architecture, modular"},{"start":39.68,"duration":6.04,"text":"design, and sustainable modernization."},{"start":43.4,"duration":4.8,"text":"In this session from scheduler to"},{"start":45.72,"duration":5.68,"text":"events, rethinking alerts in a modular"},{"start":48.2,"duration":5.28,"text":"system, Cristina will share the design"},{"start":51.4,"duration":4.56,"text":"decisions, trade-offs, and mistakes"},{"start":53.48,"duration":5.2,"text":"learned while transforming how alerts"},{"start":55.96,"duration":4.6,"text":"are generated and processed under real"},{"start":58.68,"duration":4.24,"text":"constraints."},{"start":60.56,"duration":4.32,"text":"So, for this presentation, remember"},{"start":62.92,"duration":4.36,"text":"questions through the app."},{"start":64.88,"duration":4.36,"text":"Cristina has prizes for the best"},{"start":67.28,"duration":5.72,"text":"questions. So, put your questions in"},{"start":69.24,"duration":5.12,"text":"there. There are no bad questions."},{"start":73.0,"duration":3.08,"text":"Competition time, people, and these are"},{"start":74.36,"duration":5.08,"text":"good prizes."},{"start":76.08,"duration":5.76,"text":"So, please welcome Cristina"},{"start":79.44,"duration":4.16,"text":"Musculino."},{"start":81.84,"duration":4.56,"text":">> Thank you. Thank you, Ryan, for the"},{"start":83.6,"duration":2.8,"text":"introduction."},{"start":87.28,"duration":5.84,"text":"Good afternoon, everyone, and thank you"},{"start":89.84,"duration":6.2,"text":"so much for attending my session."},{"start":93.12,"duration":2.92,"text":"Let me start it."},{"start":99.24,"duration":2.04,"text":"Uh"},{"start":105.92,"duration":3.76,"text":"One second. I think I have an issue."},{"start":112.56,"duration":5.84,"text":"Okay."},{"start":114.68,"duration":3.72,"text":"Here we go. So, uh"},{"start":123.28,"duration":2.36,"text":"Yeah."},{"start":124.36,"duration":3.4,"text":"Before we start, let me briefly"},{"start":125.64,"duration":3.72,"text":"introduce myself."},{"start":127.76,"duration":4.08,"text":"I'm Kristina."},{"start":129.36,"duration":5.2,"text":"I'm a team lead at European Central"},{"start":131.84,"duration":4.24,"text":"Bank, where I work on supervisory"},{"start":134.56,"duration":4.16,"text":"applications"},{"start":136.08,"duration":5.48,"text":"that support European banking"},{"start":138.72,"duration":2.84,"text":"supervision."},{"start":141.64,"duration":3.76,"text":"And with that, I'd like to tell you a"},{"start":143.24,"duration":3.72,"text":"story"},{"start":145.4,"duration":3.92,"text":"about"},{"start":146.96,"duration":4.68,"text":"a notification engine"},{"start":149.32,"duration":5.6,"text":"that grew far beyond"},{"start":151.64,"duration":5.2,"text":"what we originally designed it for."},{"start":154.92,"duration":3.76,"text":"Before starting, let me ask you"},{"start":156.84,"duration":6.04,"text":"something."},{"start":158.68,"duration":5.92,"text":"How many of you have ever inherited"},{"start":162.88,"duration":4.12,"text":"a system"},{"start":164.6,"duration":4.64,"text":"where your very first thought was,"},{"start":167.0,"duration":3.2,"text":"\"I really hope I don't have to change"},{"start":169.24,"duration":3.68,"text":"this.\""},{"start":170.2,"duration":2.72,"text":"Be honest."},{"start":173.0,"duration":5.36,"text":"I see quite a few hands raised."},{"start":175.88,"duration":4.28,"text":"And if you didn't raise yours, maybe"},{"start":178.36,"duration":3.88,"text":"it's simply because you've luck You've"},{"start":180.16,"duration":5.8,"text":"been lucky so far."},{"start":182.24,"duration":6.84,"text":"Because sooner or later, every engineer"},{"start":185.96,"duration":3.12,"text":"meets that system."},{"start":190.48,"duration":2.68,"text":"So,"},{"start":193.28,"duration":4.04,"text":"let me start tell you the the story of"},{"start":195.76,"duration":4.0,"text":"ours."},{"start":197.32,"duration":3.88,"text":"It's not a story about Kafka."},{"start":199.76,"duration":3.6,"text":"It's not even a story about"},{"start":201.2,"duration":4.44,"text":"notifications."},{"start":203.36,"duration":4.92,"text":"It's a story about growth."},{"start":205.64,"duration":5.04,"text":"About what happens"},{"start":208.28,"duration":6.32,"text":"when more and more people"},{"start":210.68,"duration":7.72,"text":"start depending on a system"},{"start":214.6,"duration":7.56,"text":"until changing it starts to feel risky,"},{"start":218.4,"duration":5.8,"text":"but also difficult to evolve."},{"start":222.16,"duration":4.44,"text":"Let me show you how a notification was"},{"start":224.2,"duration":4.2,"text":"created."},{"start":226.6,"duration":3.84,"text":"Every minute,"},{"start":228.4,"duration":3.96,"text":"our scheduler"},{"start":230.44,"duration":5.96,"text":"woke up."},{"start":232.36,"duration":7.04,"text":"It connected to the database of IMAS."},{"start":236.4,"duration":6.56,"text":"Let me zoom in for a second."},{"start":239.4,"duration":7.04,"text":"IMAS is one of the largest supervisory"},{"start":242.96,"duration":5.6,"text":"application in the ECB."},{"start":246.44,"duration":5.96,"text":"It supports single supervisory"},{"start":248.56,"duration":5.28,"text":"mechanism, the supervisors,"},{"start":252.4,"duration":2.28,"text":"to support"},{"start":253.84,"duration":3.44,"text":"the"},{"start":254.68,"duration":6.04,"text":"the supervision of"},{"start":257.28,"duration":7.2,"text":"insignificance banks across Europe."},{"start":260.72,"duration":7.68,"text":"It generates alerts notifications"},{"start":264.48,"duration":6.4,"text":"that are sent to supervisors whenever"},{"start":268.4,"duration":6.68,"text":"their attention is required. If a task"},{"start":270.88,"duration":5.52,"text":"is completed where a decision has to be"},{"start":275.08,"duration":2.76,"text":"approved,"},{"start":276.4,"duration":4.56,"text":"where"},{"start":277.84,"duration":5.64,"text":"or an important task status task"},{"start":280.96,"duration":2.52,"text":"changed."},{"start":283.56,"duration":3.4,"text":"So, back to our scheduler."},{"start":287.64,"duration":5.08,"text":"Every minute connected to database,"},{"start":290.24,"duration":4.28,"text":"it loaded everything it might possibly"},{"start":292.72,"duration":5.68,"text":"need."},{"start":294.52,"duration":3.88,"text":"Then, prepare the data,"},{"start":298.44,"duration":3.72,"text":"evaluated the expressions,"},{"start":302.56,"duration":4.96,"text":"generated notifications,"},{"start":305.84,"duration":4.56,"text":"and finally,"},{"start":307.52,"duration":4.0,"text":"deliver them."},{"start":310.4,"duration":5.12,"text":"That's"},{"start":311.52,"duration":4.0,"text":"simple. At least, that's how it looked."},{"start":317.24,"duration":4.28,"text":"But, honestly, when this was first"},{"start":320.64,"duration":4.4,"text":"uh"},{"start":321.52,"duration":6.48,"text":"this solution was first designed,"},{"start":325.04,"duration":5.8,"text":"it was exactly the right solution."},{"start":328.0,"duration":6.4,"text":"We had only five entities,"},{"start":330.84,"duration":3.56,"text":"a bunch of business rules."},{"start":334.48,"duration":4.84,"text":"Everything was simple. The code was easy"},{"start":337.24,"duration":4.28,"text":"to follow. Everything was fast, easy to"},{"start":339.32,"duration":3.76,"text":"understand, easy to test, easy to"},{"start":341.52,"duration":3.28,"text":"change."},{"start":343.08,"duration":3.2,"text":"At that moment,"},{"start":344.8,"duration":3.48,"text":"there There nothing wrong with this"},{"start":346.28,"duration":6.24,"text":"architecture."},{"start":348.28,"duration":4.24,"text":"The real challenge came later."},{"start":352.56,"duration":5.44,"text":"The best part, the business loved it."},{"start":356.08,"duration":3.92,"text":"Every time someone"},{"start":358.0,"duration":3.88,"text":"asked for a notification, we could"},{"start":360.0,"duration":7.48,"text":"deliver it."},{"start":361.88,"duration":6.84,"text":"Every new feature created real value."},{"start":367.48,"duration":5.0,"text":"And that's what we"},{"start":368.72,"duration":6.4,"text":"we usually want, isn't it? Success."},{"start":372.48,"duration":4.6,"text":"But success has an interesting side"},{"start":375.12,"duration":5.88,"text":"effect."},{"start":377.08,"duration":6.76,"text":"Once people notice something works,"},{"start":381.0,"duration":5.64,"text":"they all want to use it."},{"start":383.84,"duration":7.52,"text":"And that's what exactly happened."},{"start":386.64,"duration":4.72,"text":"More teams asked for notifications."},{"start":393.36,"duration":5.24,"text":"Then,"},{"start":394.64,"duration":5.2,"text":"five entities became 20."},{"start":398.6,"duration":3.72,"text":"The rest,"},{"start":399.84,"duration":4.12,"text":"nothing changed. The same database, same"},{"start":402.32,"duration":3.84,"text":"scheduler,"},{"start":403.96,"duration":5.0,"text":"same architecture."},{"start":406.16,"duration":4.72,"text":"We just kept adding more."},{"start":408.96,"duration":3.88,"text":"More notifications,"},{"start":410.88,"duration":4.88,"text":"more business rules."},{"start":412.84,"duration":4.16,"text":"And because every single addition"},{"start":415.76,"duration":5.72,"text":"worked,"},{"start":417.0,"duration":4.48,"text":"nobody had a reason to stop."},{"start":422.0,"duration":5.44,"text":"But then came the day."},{"start":424.56,"duration":6.0,"text":"It wasn't that we had more entities,"},{"start":427.44,"duration":5.16,"text":"but those entities started depending on"},{"start":430.56,"duration":5.56,"text":"one another."},{"start":432.6,"duration":5.44,"text":"Some required subscriptions, dynamic"},{"start":436.12,"duration":3.28,"text":"subscriptions."},{"start":438.04,"duration":4.24,"text":"Others"},{"start":439.4,"duration":5.96,"text":"depended on reference data."},{"start":442.28,"duration":5.4,"text":"There were special cases, exceptions,"},{"start":445.36,"duration":3.88,"text":"business-specific logic."},{"start":447.68,"duration":4.16,"text":"And of course,"},{"start":449.24,"duration":5.08,"text":"more rules."},{"start":451.84,"duration":4.0,"text":"But our scheduler didn't know any of"},{"start":454.32,"duration":4.08,"text":"that."},{"start":455.84,"duration":5.88,"text":"Every single minute,"},{"start":458.4,"duration":6.92,"text":"it loaded more data than before, whether"},{"start":461.72,"duration":3.6,"text":"anything had changed or not."},{"start":466.12,"duration":5.68,"text":"Then came the day when our architecture"},{"start":468.8,"duration":6.36,"text":"started talking back."},{"start":471.8,"duration":6.4,"text":"The first sign was memory usage."},{"start":475.16,"duration":5.64,"text":"Every execution loaded more data than"},{"start":478.2,"duration":2.6,"text":"before."},{"start":480.92,"duration":5.84,"text":"The second,"},{"start":483.36,"duration":4.88,"text":"processing time started to grow."},{"start":486.76,"duration":4.16,"text":"Remember,"},{"start":488.24,"duration":4.92,"text":"many more entities, more dependencies,"},{"start":490.92,"duration":6.56,"text":"more notifications."},{"start":493.16,"duration":7.72,"text":"And that happened every single minute."},{"start":497.48,"duration":5.48,"text":"Debugging became harder, too."},{"start":500.88,"duration":6.24,"text":"When something went wrong,"},{"start":502.96,"duration":7.76,"text":"it was immediately obvious what had when"},{"start":507.12,"duration":5.0,"text":"the problem actually started."},{"start":510.72,"duration":4.16,"text":"And"},{"start":512.12,"duration":5.16,"text":"probably the the hardest one was this"},{"start":514.88,"duration":2.4,"text":"one."},{"start":517.76,"duration":6.8,"text":"Changing one notification could"},{"start":520.32,"duration":4.24,"text":"unexpectedly affect another."},{"start":525.16,"duration":2.76,"text":"But this"},{"start":528.0,"duration":5.04,"text":"wasn't the real problem."},{"start":531.12,"duration":4.32,"text":"Our engine still worked, the"},{"start":533.04,"duration":6.04,"text":"notification was still being sent."},{"start":535.44,"duration":7.72,"text":"But every single minute, it became"},{"start":539.08,"duration":4.08,"text":"just a little bit more expensive."},{"start":543.28,"duration":4.52,"text":"Then came the day none of us forgot."},{"start":546.28,"duration":5.04,"text":"One script"},{"start":547.8,"duration":6.24,"text":"could update 10,000 records. Our SMTP"},{"start":551.32,"duration":6.12,"text":"server couldn't keep up."},{"start":554.04,"duration":8.48,"text":"The emails started flying out."},{"start":557.44,"duration":5.08,"text":"Inboxes exploded. It was memorable."},{"start":563.04,"duration":6.44,"text":"But we were we realized"},{"start":565.84,"duration":5.92,"text":"that all those issues actually"},{"start":569.48,"duration":4.36,"text":"exposed weaknesses"},{"start":571.76,"duration":3.44,"text":"over the years."},{"start":573.84,"duration":4.08,"text":"So, eventually"},{"start":575.2,"duration":4.36,"text":"gave those weaknesses names."},{"start":577.92,"duration":3.52,"text":"The first one was what we called the"},{"start":579.56,"duration":4.32,"text":"blast radius."},{"start":581.44,"duration":5.96,"text":"Changing one notification could affect"},{"start":583.88,"duration":6.36,"text":"many. A very small change"},{"start":587.4,"duration":5.64,"text":"could surprisingly affect have large"},{"start":590.24,"duration":5.4,"text":"consequences."},{"start":593.04,"duration":4.96,"text":"Then polling the past."},{"start":595.64,"duration":6.48,"text":"Every minute we were searching the"},{"start":598.0,"duration":7.92,"text":"database hoping something would change."},{"start":602.12,"duration":3.8,"text":"Most of the time nothing happened."},{"start":606.64,"duration":5.16,"text":"Then came the email storm."},{"start":609.64,"duration":4.24,"text":"It wasn't that the scheduler was sending"},{"start":611.8,"duration":4.72,"text":"too many notification"},{"start":613.88,"duration":6.36,"text":"the wrong notifications. It was simply"},{"start":616.52,"duration":5.4,"text":"sending far too many of them."},{"start":620.24,"duration":4.32,"text":"And then the one that worried us the"},{"start":621.92,"duration":6.96,"text":"most was this one."},{"start":624.56,"duration":9.28,"text":"Imagine an alert becomes active."},{"start":628.88,"duration":8.16,"text":"Few seconds later someone resolves it."},{"start":633.84,"duration":5.96,"text":"Our scheduler checks every minute"},{"start":637.04,"duration":5.36,"text":"and by the time it wakes up"},{"start":639.8,"duration":4.32,"text":"the alert has already disappeared."},{"start":642.4,"duration":4.76,"text":"The notification"},{"start":644.12,"duration":5.64,"text":"was never sent."},{"start":647.16,"duration":6.08,"text":"So"},{"start":649.76,"duration":3.48,"text":"we had to um"},{"start":653.8,"duration":3.08,"text":"we had to um"},{"start":657.04,"duration":6.68,"text":"decide how to fix this issue."},{"start":660.24,"duration":7.72,"text":"We explored three different directions."},{"start":663.72,"duration":6.4,"text":"The first was the lowest risk one."},{"start":667.96,"duration":4.44,"text":"The second"},{"start":670.12,"duration":4.56,"text":"moved us much closer to a real"},{"start":672.4,"duration":4.8,"text":"processing time."},{"start":674.68,"duration":5.8,"text":"And the third"},{"start":677.2,"duration":6.84,"text":"was the most scalable one."},{"start":680.48,"duration":6.24,"text":"On paper they all look good."},{"start":684.04,"duration":6.28,"text":"But we weren't trying to"},{"start":686.72,"duration":6.0,"text":"choose the most impressive architecture."},{"start":690.32,"duration":3.84,"text":"We were trying to choose the best next"},{"start":692.72,"duration":4.64,"text":"step."},{"start":694.16,"duration":5.76,"text":"Because good architecture isn't about"},{"start":697.36,"duration":6.32,"text":"making the biggest leap."},{"start":699.92,"duration":3.76,"text":"It's about making the right one."},{"start":704.36,"duration":3.8,"text":"We chose option A."},{"start":706.2,"duration":5.2,"text":"Why?"},{"start":708.16,"duration":6.2,"text":"Let's compare the two approaches."},{"start":711.4,"duration":5.72,"text":"Before, our scheduler"},{"start":714.36,"duration":4.84,"text":"rebuilt the entire picture."},{"start":717.12,"duration":5.32,"text":"It loaded everything."},{"start":719.2,"duration":6.08,"text":"And only after that"},{"start":722.44,"duration":3.84,"text":"it evaluated the rules."},{"start":725.28,"duration":3.08,"text":"So,"},{"start":726.28,"duration":4.76,"text":"we asked ourselves a very simple"},{"start":728.36,"duration":7.08,"text":"question."},{"start":731.04,"duration":8.4,"text":"What if we turn the process around?"},{"start":735.44,"duration":6.68,"text":"What if instead of loading any data,"},{"start":739.44,"duration":5.0,"text":"why not start with the rules?"},{"start":742.12,"duration":5.32,"text":"Because every rule"},{"start":744.44,"duration":5.28,"text":"knows already which entities it depends"},{"start":747.44,"duration":2.28,"text":"on."},{"start":749.84,"duration":5.12,"text":"Only after that,"},{"start":751.8,"duration":5.44,"text":"we asked, \"What has changed since the"},{"start":754.96,"duration":5.8,"text":"previous execution?\""},{"start":757.24,"duration":6.6,"text":"And then, we load only the data required"},{"start":760.76,"duration":5.96,"text":"for those rules."},{"start":763.84,"duration":6.4,"text":"Instead of rebuilding the entire world,"},{"start":766.72,"duration":6.36,"text":"we fetch only what's needed."},{"start":770.24,"duration":5.88,"text":"One simple idea."},{"start":773.08,"duration":7.32,"text":"One different way of thinking."},{"start":776.12,"duration":4.28,"text":"And that changed everything."},{"start":783.12,"duration":5.68,"text":"While improving while while while uh"},{"start":785.32,"duration":3.48,"text":"implementing the option A,"},{"start":789.88,"duration":6.96,"text":"we were realizing something."},{"start":792.52,"duration":5.92,"text":"We weren't improving uh the performance."},{"start":796.84,"duration":3.72,"text":"We were improving the architecture"},{"start":798.44,"duration":4.44,"text":"itself."},{"start":800.56,"duration":5.0,"text":"So, that led us to a"},{"start":802.88,"duration":5.0,"text":"design principle."},{"start":805.56,"duration":6.2,"text":"Keep the core stable."},{"start":807.88,"duration":6.68,"text":"Make the edges replaceable."},{"start":811.76,"duration":4.96,"text":"Everything in this purple box it's where"},{"start":814.56,"duration":3.88,"text":"the business value lives."},{"start":816.72,"duration":5.92,"text":"The rule engine loading only the"},{"start":818.44,"duration":8.72,"text":"required data creating notifications."},{"start":822.64,"duration":7.32,"text":"Today our schedule triggers the process."},{"start":827.16,"duration":6.12,"text":"Simple reliable."},{"start":829.96,"duration":4.8,"text":"That's what we exactly need today."},{"start":833.28,"duration":4.08,"text":"Tomorrow"},{"start":834.76,"duration":4.24,"text":"maybe an IM service will publish Kafka"},{"start":837.36,"duration":4.16,"text":"events."},{"start":839.0,"duration":4.4,"text":"That's perfectly fine. We don't have to"},{"start":841.52,"duration":4.88,"text":"change the business logic."},{"start":843.4,"duration":6.64,"text":"We only replace the trigger."},{"start":846.4,"duration":5.92,"text":"And one day if our system"},{"start":850.04,"duration":4.92,"text":"evolves even further"},{"start":852.32,"duration":4.2,"text":"CDC together with Kafka might become"},{"start":854.96,"duration":2.8,"text":"another option."},{"start":856.52,"duration":5.48,"text":"Again"},{"start":857.76,"duration":6.48,"text":"the core remains exactly the same."},{"start":862.0,"duration":6.96,"text":"Three different triggers."},{"start":864.24,"duration":4.72,"text":"One identical notification system."},{"start":872.2,"duration":4.6,"text":"Do you remember all those"},{"start":874.48,"duration":5.72,"text":"uh six problems? Memory usage,"},{"start":876.8,"duration":6.12,"text":"performance missed alerts."},{"start":880.2,"duration":5.96,"text":"They all had the same root cause. But"},{"start":882.92,"duration":4.76,"text":"for many years we treated them as"},{"start":886.16,"duration":4.72,"text":"separate"},{"start":887.68,"duration":5.6,"text":"completely separate problems."},{"start":890.88,"duration":6.32,"text":"Once we fix that"},{"start":893.28,"duration":3.92,"text":"the improvements came naturally."},{"start":898.08,"duration":5.0,"text":"Less data loaded. 90% uh unnecessary"},{"start":902.04,"duration":5.84,"text":"data."},{"start":903.08,"duration":6.84,"text":"And that means also less memory usage."},{"start":907.88,"duration":4.84,"text":"Because we stopped we simply stopped"},{"start":909.92,"duration":5.44,"text":"loading more data."},{"start":912.72,"duration":5.28,"text":"Faster execution times."},{"start":915.36,"duration":6.52,"text":"And those were not all the improvements"},{"start":918.0,"duration":3.88,"text":"that our users noticed."},{"start":922.0,"duration":3.8,"text":"The notifications became relevant."},{"start":926.16,"duration":4.32,"text":"Failures became isolated."},{"start":928.92,"duration":3.76,"text":"Alerts"},{"start":930.48,"duration":4.52,"text":"became reliable."},{"start":932.68,"duration":4.96,"text":"Those were the improvements our users"},{"start":935.0,"duration":2.64,"text":"noticed."},{"start":939.24,"duration":5.0,"text":"Looking back, I don't think we fixed six"},{"start":942.12,"duration":3.56,"text":"different problems."},{"start":944.24,"duration":4.0,"text":"We solved"},{"start":945.68,"duration":4.76,"text":"one architectural issue"},{"start":948.24,"duration":3.72,"text":"and six different"},{"start":950.44,"duration":4.6,"text":"symptoms."},{"start":951.96,"duration":3.08,"text":"Simply disappeared."},{"start":955.68,"duration":5.04,"text":"If there is one thing I'd like to take"},{"start":958.16,"duration":5.68,"text":"you take away from this talk"},{"start":960.72,"duration":6.76,"text":"is these three ideas."},{"start":963.84,"duration":6.16,"text":"Architecture is a team sport."},{"start":967.48,"duration":5.32,"text":"The hardest part of this project wasn't"},{"start":970.0,"duration":5.44,"text":"about writing the code."},{"start":972.8,"duration":5.6,"text":"It was about disagreeing where"},{"start":975.44,"duration":7.6,"text":"responsibilities belong."},{"start":978.4,"duration":4.64,"text":"Once boundaries became clear,"},{"start":983.36,"duration":4.52,"text":"the implementation was straightforward."},{"start":986.68,"duration":3.24,"text":"Because"},{"start":987.88,"duration":5.04,"text":"good architecture starts with good"},{"start":989.92,"duration":3.0,"text":"conversations."},{"start":992.96,"duration":6.08,"text":"Second,"},{"start":994.84,"duration":5.36,"text":"make your system systems observable."},{"start":999.04,"duration":3.32,"text":"Because"},{"start":1000.2,"duration":5.96,"text":"when something goes wrong, you don't"},{"start":1002.36,"duration":3.8,"text":"want to guess. You want to know."},{"start":1006.56,"duration":5.32,"text":"And finally, simplicity wins."},{"start":1009.2,"duration":4.56,"text":"We explored Kafka, CDC, different"},{"start":1011.88,"duration":3.6,"text":"event-driven approaches."},{"start":1013.76,"duration":3.8,"text":"In the end,"},{"start":1015.48,"duration":3.64,"text":"the best solution"},{"start":1017.56,"duration":4.08,"text":"was the one"},{"start":1019.12,"duration":5.96,"text":"that fixed today's problem without"},{"start":1021.64,"duration":3.44,"text":"closing the door on tomorrow."},{"start":1025.52,"duration":4.04,"text":"If I have to summarize this entire"},{"start":1027.88,"duration":5.88,"text":"project"},{"start":1029.56,"duration":7.48,"text":"in one simple sentence,"},{"start":1033.76,"duration":6.56,"text":"great architecture"},{"start":1037.04,"duration":3.28,"text":"makes change"},{"start":1041.44,"duration":2.68,"text":"boring."},{"start":1044.64,"duration":6.0,"text":"Because when change Adding a feature"},{"start":1047.36,"duration":3.28,"text":"isn't stressful."},{"start":1051.16,"duration":4.72,"text":"When one change doesn't bring five"},{"start":1053.48,"duration":5.92,"text":"others."},{"start":1055.88,"duration":6.04,"text":"And when deployments are not scary."},{"start":1059.4,"duration":7.0,"text":"That's when you know"},{"start":1061.92,"duration":4.48,"text":"an architecture is doing its job."},{"start":1067.88,"duration":5.64,"text":"And this is not the end of the story."},{"start":1069.88,"duration":3.64,"text":"This is simply the next chapter."},{"start":1073.92,"duration":4.28,"text":"The next step is moving to uh toward"},{"start":1076.16,"duration":4.32,"text":"domain events. Instead of constantly"},{"start":1078.2,"duration":4.08,"text":"asking what has changed,"},{"start":1080.48,"duration":4.68,"text":"the business simply tells us. It's a"},{"start":1082.28,"duration":5.36,"text":"much cleaner model."},{"start":1085.16,"duration":5.56,"text":"We are also integrating with the ECB"},{"start":1087.64,"duration":6.2,"text":"central notification system."},{"start":1090.72,"duration":5.16,"text":"Because notifications shouldn't belong"},{"start":1093.84,"duration":5.6,"text":"to one application."},{"start":1095.88,"duration":7.6,"text":"They should become a shared capability."},{"start":1099.44,"duration":6.52,"text":"And the one that I'm most proud of"},{"start":1103.48,"duration":5.24,"text":"We don't know what the future will"},{"start":1105.96,"duration":5.72,"text":"next trigger will be in the future."},{"start":1108.72,"duration":5.56,"text":"Maybe domain events, maybe Kafka, maybe"},{"start":1111.68,"duration":5.0,"text":"something none of us has even imagined"},{"start":1114.28,"duration":2.4,"text":"yet."},{"start":1116.96,"duration":5.52,"text":"We simply replace the trigger. We don't"},{"start":1119.44,"duration":5.56,"text":"have to redesign the entire notification"},{"start":1122.48,"duration":2.52,"text":"engine."},{"start":1125.8,"duration":4.52,"text":"From one notification engine to a shared"},{"start":1128.8,"duration":2.72,"text":"platform."},{"start":1130.32,"duration":5.4,"text":"For me,"},{"start":1131.52,"duration":4.2,"text":"that's designing for change looks like."},{"start":1141.4,"duration":8.12,"text":"As engineers, we usually measure success"},{"start":1144.44,"duration":8.76,"text":"in uh milliseconds, CPU,"},{"start":1149.52,"duration":6.92,"text":"performance. All those things matters."},{"start":1153.2,"duration":6.28,"text":"But I don't think that's what makes"},{"start":1156.44,"duration":6.8,"text":"an architecture successful."},{"start":1159.48,"duration":3.76,"text":"For me success is much simpler."},{"start":1163.28,"duration":8.44,"text":"Can another developer add a new feature"},{"start":1167.6,"duration":4.12,"text":"without wondering what else might break?"},{"start":1172.28,"duration":3.16,"text":"If the answer is yes,"},{"start":1176.16,"duration":4.84,"text":"the architecture, the good architecture,"},{"start":1179.4,"duration":4.28,"text":"is the one that gave the people"},{"start":1181.0,"duration":2.68,"text":"confidence."},{"start":1185.0,"duration":5.56,"text":"So, I'd like to leave you with one"},{"start":1187.52,"duration":3.04,"text":"simple thought."},{"start":1191.0,"duration":4.32,"text":"Build for change,"},{"start":1192.96,"duration":5.32,"text":"not for today."},{"start":1195.32,"duration":4.48,"text":"Because today's software"},{"start":1198.28,"duration":2.96,"text":"will probably"},{"start":1199.8,"duration":4.56,"text":"become"},{"start":1201.24,"duration":3.12,"text":"tomorrow's legacy."},{"start":1204.52,"duration":4.36,"text":"Thank you so much. I'd be happy to take"},{"start":1207.12,"duration":3.08,"text":"any questions."},{"start":1208.88,"duration":3.76,"text":"And"},{"start":1210.2,"duration":4.92,"text":"as Ryan said,"},{"start":1212.64,"duration":4.72,"text":"for the three first three questions, I"},{"start":1215.12,"duration":5.08,"text":"have some ECB souvenirs with me. They"},{"start":1217.36,"duration":2.84,"text":"are very cool."},{"start":1223.36,"duration":3.52,"text":"Thank you."},{"start":1224.86,"duration":2.02,"text":">> [applause]"},{"start":1229.68,"duration":3.92,"text":">> Oh, wow. You guys did great. I mean,"},{"start":1232.0,"duration":3.24,"text":"there's so many questions in here that"},{"start":1233.6,"duration":2.24,"text":"just came in in the last couple of"},{"start":1235.24,"duration":1.2,"text":"minutes."},{"start":1235.84,"duration":2.8,"text":">> Thank you."},{"start":1236.44,"duration":4.12,"text":">> Wonderful. All right. So,"},{"start":1238.64,"duration":5.12,"text":"what do we have here?"},{"start":1240.56,"duration":3.2,"text":">> Nice to meet you and congratulations."},{"start":1245.92,"duration":3.0,"text":">> Uh, how long did it take to implement"},{"start":1247.84,"duration":1.6,"text":"the changes?"},{"start":1248.92,"duration":3.4,"text":">> Yeah."},{"start":1249.44,"duration":4.72,"text":">> Uh, almost uh 1 year and we are still"},{"start":1252.32,"duration":4.28,"text":"working on it because"},{"start":1254.16,"duration":4.32,"text":"uh as I mentioned, we are integrating it"},{"start":1256.6,"duration":3.68,"text":"with the ECB central notification"},{"start":1258.48,"duration":4.0,"text":"system."},{"start":1260.28,"duration":5.48,"text":">> Okay."},{"start":1262.48,"duration":5.24,"text":">> Uh, I think this one is a very good one."},{"start":1265.76,"duration":3.76,"text":"Uh, hi. What are your alerts actually"},{"start":1267.72,"duration":3.16,"text":"about? It's a very good one because I"},{"start":1269.52,"duration":2.76,"text":"didn't mention it. There are so many"},{"start":1270.88,"duration":5.12,"text":"things in there."},{"start":1272.28,"duration":5.76,"text":"Um, okay. Uh, what types of data are you"},{"start":1276.0,"duration":4.28,"text":"loading? And, uh, does it contain right"},{"start":1278.04,"duration":4.24,"text":"time logic? Okay, I will try to, uh,"},{"start":1280.28,"duration":4.76,"text":"answer this."},{"start":1282.28,"duration":6.72,"text":"So, notifications are simply, uh,"},{"start":1285.04,"duration":8.0,"text":"messages to, uh, keep the supervisor in,"},{"start":1289.0,"duration":5.72,"text":"uh, notified on something. But, alerts,"},{"start":1293.04,"duration":3.64,"text":"uh, they are more a bit more"},{"start":1294.72,"duration":4.32,"text":"complicated. There are, uh, we have"},{"start":1296.68,"duration":4.08,"text":"rules for open and close alert. What"},{"start":1299.04,"duration":5.84,"text":"that means?"},{"start":1300.76,"duration":5.76,"text":"Um, there is an expression on both"},{"start":1304.88,"duration":4.44,"text":"uh,"},{"start":1306.52,"duration":5.0,"text":"open and close alerts."},{"start":1309.32,"duration":5.0,"text":"When something change, I will give you"},{"start":1311.52,"duration":4.32,"text":"an example. When When a supervisor has"},{"start":1314.32,"duration":3.24,"text":"to approve"},{"start":1315.84,"duration":3.72,"text":"a decision,"},{"start":1317.56,"duration":4.12,"text":"they receive an alert."},{"start":1319.56,"duration":6.2,"text":"And they can click on on a link and go"},{"start":1321.68,"duration":6.48,"text":"to iMAS and click on the button approve."},{"start":1325.76,"duration":4.08,"text":"And those alerts will be sent to the"},{"start":1328.16,"duration":3.56,"text":"supervisor"},{"start":1329.84,"duration":3.64,"text":"until the supervisor actually will take"},{"start":1331.72,"duration":4.4,"text":"that action."},{"start":1333.48,"duration":5.12,"text":"When they When they take it, the the"},{"start":1336.12,"duration":4.6,"text":"alert can be closed."},{"start":1338.6,"duration":5.28,"text":"So, that is That's why we have open and"},{"start":1340.72,"duration":5.04,"text":"close to make sure that the action"},{"start":1343.88,"duration":2.88,"text":"required is, um,"},{"start":1345.76,"duration":3.12,"text":"is completed."},{"start":1346.76,"duration":4.96,"text":">> Okay. One more."},{"start":1348.88,"duration":2.84,"text":">> Um,"},{"start":1355.32,"duration":5.76,"text":"Okay. How to"},{"start":1357.64,"duration":3.44,"text":"Oh, okay. I will I'm trying to"},{"start":1363.2,"duration":0.96,"text":"Yeah."},{"start":1363.72,"duration":1.88,"text":">> Yeah."},{"start":1364.16,"duration":3.76,"text":">> Uh, I think also this one is good"},{"start":1365.6,"duration":3.8,"text":"because it's related to alerts. How does"},{"start":1367.92,"duration":3.08,"text":"the new scheduler actually solve the"},{"start":1369.4,"duration":3.8,"text":"ghost issue? That's That's a very good"},{"start":1371.0,"duration":3.88,"text":"one."},{"start":1373.2,"duration":4.08,"text":"And I think that comes from from a"},{"start":1374.88,"duration":4.36,"text":"colleague of mine. Before, when the"},{"start":1377.28,"duration":5.8,"text":"scheduler started to to process"},{"start":1379.24,"duration":6.24,"text":"everything, uh, they checked both"},{"start":1383.08,"duration":5.44,"text":"opening and closing rules."},{"start":1385.48,"duration":5.16,"text":"And when the alert was fixed, the"},{"start":1388.52,"duration":5.24,"text":"closing rule was"},{"start":1390.64,"duration":4.28,"text":"was completed, and it didn't open it"},{"start":1393.76,"duration":2.44,"text":"yet."},{"start":1394.92,"duration":2.84,"text":"So, now"},{"start":1396.2,"duration":4.44,"text":"every time the scheduler triggers the"},{"start":1397.76,"duration":6.48,"text":"process, we don't start with a closing"},{"start":1400.64,"duration":4.84,"text":"rule. We start with the open rule."},{"start":1404.24,"duration":3.2,"text":"That was That was it."},{"start":1405.48,"duration":4.96,"text":">> Okay, so we've got three winners. I"},{"start":1407.44,"duration":3.36,"text":"think it was a"},{"start":1410.44,"duration":1.68,"text":"What's that?"},{"start":1410.8,"duration":2.52,"text":">> Yeah, uh, Caesar?"},{"start":1412.12,"duration":2.44,"text":">> Caesar,"},{"start":1413.32,"duration":3.24,"text":">> Uh, yeah."},{"start":1414.56,"duration":3.0,"text":">> Lin Tao, and Tomas."},{"start":1416.56,"duration":2.68,"text":">> Please come here."},{"start":1417.56,"duration":3.36,"text":">> to the stage."},{"start":1419.24,"duration":3.44,"text":">> Thank you so much."},{"start":1420.92,"duration":2.6,"text":">> All right. So, thank you very much,"},{"start":1422.68,"duration":4.4,"text":"Cristina."},{"start":1423.52,"duration":3.56,"text":">> Thank you. Thank you, Ryan."}]}